{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game-Player System.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game-Player System.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game player system game player system","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game-Player System.md","fileName":"Game-Player System.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game-Player System","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 14:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Game Mechanics and Rules]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Mechanics and Rules","Interactivity","Engagement","Designer Loop","Game as Conversation","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game-Player System.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game-Player System.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game player system game player system","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game-Player System.md","fileName":"Game-Player System.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game-Player System","heading":"Game-Player System","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The game-player system treats the game and the player as interacting subsystems of one functional whole. The game supplies a dynamic model and feedback; the player supplies intentions, decisions, actions, and learning.\n\nNeither subsystem alone creates the played experience. Their reciprocal exchange forms [[Interactivity]], produces [[Engagement]], and supplies the higher-level whole observed and changed through the [[Designer Loop]].\n\nThis exchange can be understood as a [[Game as Conversation|conversation]]. The creator speaks through rules and context, the player responds through verbs and choices, and the system's resistance and feedback shape what each action means.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Mechanics and Rules","Interactivity","Engagement","Designer Loop","Game as Conversation","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Game-Player System.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Game-Player System.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"game player system game player system","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Game-Player System.md","fileName":"Game-Player System.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Game-Player System","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[advancedgamedesign.pdf]]\n[[agamedesignvocabulary.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Mechanics and Rules","Interactivity","Engagement","Designer Loop","Game as Conversation","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}